title: A process an extension leaves running, detached, ends when the app is left: nothing of it is still writing once the app starts again
folders: rust-small
extensions: child-extension
expect-log: extension qa\.fake-child started
expect-file: rust-small/qa-spawned.txt :: \Aspawned
expect-file: rust-small/qa-alive.txt :: \Atick\r?\n[\s\S]*tick\r?\nAGAIN\r?\n\z

wait 3500
quit

=== again
wait 1500
touch qa-alive.txt AGAIN
wait 3000
quit
